#N canvas 40 40 1150 820 12;
#X text 10 5 [ddj-bpm <deck $0>] - estimates the tempo of the loaded track: peak envelope (512-sample frames over up to 30 s) -> onset strength -> autocorrelation over 75-175 bpm \, weighted toward 120 \, refined with parabolic interpolation;
